        <h1 class="page__title">About Praveen Kumar</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="page__content markdown">
        <p>Hi, I'm <strong>Praveen Kumar</strong>, and this is my little corner of the internet.</p>

        <p>I like building websites, learning SEO and actually applying what I learn. A lot of my time goes into studying search results, testing content ideas, improving websites and trying to understand what makes a page useful enough to get organic traffic.</p>

        <p>I also enjoy following <strong>trending startups, business ideas, marketing strategies and technology</strong>. I like seeing how new products are built, how companies market themselves and what makes an idea work.</p>

        <p>Since I am based around Warangal, I also want to write more about the things I experience locally — especially <strong>food, restaurants, places to visit, businesses and interesting things around Warangal and Telangana</strong>.</p>

        <p><img eleventy:ignore src="{{ '/assets/images/praveen-kumar-warangal.jpg' | url }}" alt="Praveen Kumar in Warangal" width="500" style="display:block; width:500px; max-width:100%; height:auto; margin:1.5rem 0;" /></p>

        <h2>What I Like</h2>

        <ul>
            <li><strong>SEO:</strong> Studying search, testing ideas and working on organic growth.</li>
            <li><strong>Websites:</strong> Building and experimenting with websites and different web technologies.</li>
            <li><strong>Startups:</strong> Following new companies, products and interesting business ideas.</li>
            <li><strong>Marketing:</strong> Learning how brands attract people and grow.</li>
            <li><strong>Warangal:</strong> Exploring the city and writing about useful local information.</li>
            <li><strong>Food:</strong> Trying local restaurants, cafés and street food and sharing my own experience.</li>
            <li><strong>Technology:</strong> Learning by building things rather than only reading about them.</li>
        </ul>

        <p><img eleventy:ignore src="{{ '/assets/images/praveen-kumar-ramappa.jpg' | url }}" alt="Praveen Kumar exploring a local destination" width="500" style="display:block; width:500px; max-width:100%; height:auto; margin:1.5rem 0;" /></p>

        <h2>Why Maverick Times?</h2>

        <p>I enjoy the whole process of blogging: finding something interesting, researching it, building a page, trying to get it discovered through SEO and then looking at what people actually search for and read.</p>

        <p>So Maverick Times is a place where I can do exactly that. Some articles will be about Warangal and local food, some will be about websites and SEO, and others might be about startups, marketing or another niche I happen to be exploring.</p>

        <p>I am not trying to make this a huge publication overnight. I would rather keep learning, keep building and slowly create useful articles that people actually want to read.</p>

        <p><strong>That's basically what Maverick Times is about: building, learning, experimenting and sharing what I find.</strong></p>
